cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these write-ups, please cite them as below."
title: "Rentcraft: an open research log on teaching small neural networks to play a Monopoly-style board game"
authors:
  - alias: q3ok
url: "https://github.com/q3ok/rentcraft"
repository-code: "https://github.com/q3ok/rentcraft"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Public write-ups of Rentcraft, a Monopoly-style board game written from scratch as a research testbed for
  game-playing AI. The research log documents experiments with small neural networks and rule-based bots,
  including open-ended trade negotiation, tournament results, failed approaches, and their limitations.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - imitation learning
  - board games
  - Monopoly-style game
  - negotiation
  - trading
  - PPO
  - DAgger
  - transformers
